                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/4078 Suppl.: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Haiti</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Sparks</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-10-12T13:00:00-05:00">October 12, 1940—1
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>168. Department’s 166, October 11, 1940. Please telegraph latest information on
                    the political and budgetary situation so that it will be available to the
                    Department prior to a conference scheduled with M. Dennis for October 14, at 10
                    a.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
